1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,725
See this glowing dot?

2
00:00:01,725 --> 00:00:03,550
That's the whole universe.

3
00:00:03,680 --> 00:00:05,180
Let me show you why.

4
00:00:05,435 --> 00:00:07,210
This is a black hole.

5
00:00:07,210 --> 00:00:08,940
And this bright ring is hot gas,

6
00:00:08,940 --> 00:00:10,320
spinning around it.

7
00:00:10,540 --> 00:00:11,950
Let's look at it from above.

8
00:00:12,680 --> 00:00:13,445
See?

9
00:00:13,445 --> 00:00:15,422
The disk is actually flat.

10
00:00:15,490 --> 00:00:17,100
This is the back half.

11
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:18,861
And this is the front half.

12
00:00:19,105 --> 00:00:20,160
Now watch the back half,

13
00:00:20,160 --> 00:00:21,682
as we go back down.

14
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:23,840
The black hole bends its light,

15
00:00:23,840 --> 00:00:25,570
up over the top...

16
00:00:25,570 --> 00:00:26,820
and under the bottom.

17
00:00:27,075 --> 00:00:28,860
Now let's fly in closer.

18
00:00:28,860 --> 00:00:30,440
Much closer.

19
00:00:30,840 --> 00:00:32,195
If you hover right here,

20
00:00:32,195 --> 00:00:33,100
the black hole fills

21
00:00:33,100 --> 00:00:35,720
exactly half your sky.

22
00:00:35,720 --> 00:00:37,355
And see this thin line?

23
00:00:37,355 --> 00:00:37,635
That's light,

24
00:00:37,635 --> 00:00:40,485
going around the black hole in a circle.

25
00:00:40,485 --> 00:00:42,865
Light can go all the way around...

26
00:00:42,865 --> 00:00:44,130
and come back to you.

27
00:00:44,465 --> 00:00:45,440
So in this line,

28
00:00:45,440 --> 00:00:47,829
you see the back of your own head.

29
00:00:48,185 --> 00:00:49,180
Now let's go lower,

30
00:00:49,180 --> 00:00:51,740
and hover just above the edge.

31
00:00:51,740 --> 00:00:52,689
Then look up.

32
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:54,320
The whole universe shrinks

33
00:00:54,320 --> 00:00:57,309
into one small dot above you.

34
00:00:57,685 --> 00:00:58,540
And down here,

35
00:00:58,540 --> 00:01:00,029
time runs slower.

36
00:01:00,185 --> 00:01:01,725
Stay for one minute...

37
00:01:01,725 --> 00:01:04,205
and half an hour goes by out there.

38
00:01:04,205 --> 00:01:06,240
And all this darkness around the dot?

39
00:01:06,240 --> 00:01:07,629
That's the black hole.
